WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:01.770
What's up everybody!

00:00:01.770 --> 00:00:02.770
We are Pongfinity

00:00:02.770 --> 00:00:07.220
And today we are taking table tennis to the
sunny streets of Helsinki.

00:00:07.220 --> 00:00:10.320
We'll be challenging strangers to a game of
table tennis

00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:11.820
With these 3 items.

00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:15.240
They will get to choose which one we will
play with.

00:00:15.240 --> 00:00:16.910
If they manage to beat us

00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:20.460
We will give them 20 euros.

00:00:20.480 --> 00:00:21.760
Let's go!

00:02:13.520 --> 00:02:15.040
Well, that was not an easy match

00:02:15.400 --> 00:02:17.800
but luckily I won.

00:05:53.680 --> 00:05:54.480
Thanks man.

00:05:54.560 --> 00:05:55.480
Yeah, no problem!

00:05:56.080 --> 00:05:56.720
Thank you, thank you.

00:06:01.200 --> 00:06:02.560
We need a picture!

00:06:08.980 --> 00:06:09.760
Have a good one!

00:06:09.820 --> 00:06:10.460
You too!

00:06:11.400 --> 00:06:13.920
So, unfortunately our first loss.

00:06:14.660 --> 00:06:16.440
The wind wasn't on our side and...

00:06:16.440 --> 00:06:18.880
the plate wasn't quite my strength...

00:06:18.940 --> 00:06:19.580
Yea yea, excuses excuses!

00:09:46.040 --> 00:09:46.880
Alright, today

00:09:47.090 --> 00:09:51.090
we found one guy who was able to beat Miikka
with a plate.

00:09:51.090 --> 00:09:52.820
Congratulations to him!

00:09:52.820 --> 00:09:54.930
We had a lot of fun filming this episode

00:09:54.930 --> 00:09:57.390
If you enjoyed it too, remember to leave it
a thumbs up

00:09:57.390 --> 00:09:59.900
And subscribe to our channel.

00:09:59.900 --> 00:10:02.800
Until next time!

